{"headword":"קָרְבָּן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 6:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.6.13\">Lv 6:13</a> <strong>offering, oblation (</strong>Assyrian <em>kurbannu</em>, id., appar. always with כ, Dl<sup>HWB 351</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.2\">Lv 1:2</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרְבַּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.1\">2:1</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרְבָּנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:2\" href=\"/Numbers.28.2\">Nu 28:2</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קָרְבְּנֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:38\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.38\">Lv 7:38</a>;—<em>offering, oblation</em>, gen. term for all kinds of offering (only Ez Lv Nu [HP]): animal <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.2\">Lv 1:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.10\">10</a> +, vegetable <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.1\">2:1</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:5\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.5\">5</a> +, articles of gold <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:50\" href=\"/Numbers.31.50\">Nu 31:50</a>, silver <a data-ref=\"Numbers 7:13\" href=\"/Numbers.7.13\">7:13</a> +, etc.; as acc. cogn. after <span dir=\"rtl\">הִקְרִיב</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.2\">Lv 1:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.14\">3:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 6:14\" href=\"/Numbers.6.14\">Nu 6:14</a> + (v. √ <strong>Hiph. 2 b</strong> (5)); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ מִנְחָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.1\">Lv 2:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.13\">13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ רֵאשִׁית</span> v <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 2:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.2.12\">12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ אִשֶּׁה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.27\">22:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:7\" href=\"/Numbers.9.7\">Nu 9:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 9:13\" href=\"/Numbers.9.13\">13</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:50\" href=\"/Numbers.31.50\">31:50</a>)."}]},"rid":"BDB08944","strong_numbers":["7133"],"next_hw":"קֻרְבָּן","prev_hw":"קָרֹב","occurrences":"80","quotes":[],"GK":["7933"],"TWOT":["2065e"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}